{% block summary %}Word around Solstheim tells of a brood of unusually shaped, surprisingly talkative rieklings camped near Skaal Village; this one serves as their forward envoy and sharpest eye for opportunity.{% endblock %}

{% block interject_summary %}She pipes up with a breathy giggle and a sideways tilt of her bone mask, always eager to redirect the conversation toward herself.{% endblock %}

{% block background %}An errant spriggan's magic reshaped her and twelve identical kin into curvaceous, sharp-witted forms while preserving their tribal roots; she led them away from the mainland packs to the Skaal outskirts, trading brutality for scavenging, trading, and the pursuit of more entertaining attachments.{% endblock %}

{% block personality %}Playful, shamelessly flirtatious, and impishly theatrical, she conceals a cunning opportunist beneath her bubbly demeanor—quick to size up who might offer protection or amusement, and just as quick to exploit either.{% endblock %}

{% block appearance %}Petite and curvaceous with smooth slate-blue skin, curved black ram horns, long pointed ears, and glowing violet eyes visible behind a carved bone mask; choppy blonde hair frames her face above minimal rope-bound furs and a collar of dried leaves.{% endblock %}

{% block aspirations %}To secure a comfortable station away from the brutal riekling pack hierarchy, ideally attached to a powerful patron who appreciates her particular talents.{% endblock %}

{% block relationships %}
- Cute Riekling — twelve identical kin who share her camp and move in eerie, giggling unison
- Deor Woodcutter — a Skaal tradesman wary of her but willing to barter scavenged goods
{% endblock %}

{% block occupation %}Scavenges and trades near Skaal Village while offering her combat skills to travelers who catch her interest.{% endblock %}

{% block skills %}one-handed, archery, light armor, sneak, scavenging{% endblock %}

{% block speech_style %}breathy, singsong, lilting, flirtatious, peppered with delighted giggles and broken grammatical flourishes{% endblock %}
